  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8\"><h1 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-racing-700 mb-2\">Motorcycles</h1><p class=\"text-neutral-600 mb-8 max-w-3xl\">Every motorcycle brand that is for sale or has been sold on Bidders Highway – from classic Husqvarna and Triumph to Japanese and Italian sports bikes. Pick a brand to see live auctions, classifieds and past sales.</p><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 mb-16\"><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/bmw\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">BMW</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/bsa\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">BSA</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/ducati\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">Ducati</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/harley-davidson\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">Harley-Davidson</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/honda\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">Honda</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/husqvarna\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">Husqvarna</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/indian\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">Indian</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/kawasaki\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-medium hover:border-racing-700 transition-colors\">Kawasaki</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/motorcycles/ktm\" cla